# User Stories

## Primary users
1. As an online shopper, I want product recommendations so I can decide faster.
2. As a shopper with a budget, I want products filtered by price and need.
3. As a shopper, I want to know why a product was recommended.

## Secondary users
4. As a new online shopper, I want simple search and comparison so I do not get lost.

## Advisor stories reserved for Sprint 3
5. As a user, I want to type "I want a hard drive under $100" and see matching products.
6. As a user, I want a match score and short reasons.
7. As a user, I want Help me choose to compare the closest match and the lowest price.
